{"name":"Wildfire","hex":"#ff8833","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"wildfire","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A rapidly spreading fire, especially one occurring in a wildland area.","Greek fire."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/wildfire"}],"entries":[{"title":"Wildfire","blocks":[{"text":"A wildfire, forest fire, brushfire or a bushfire is an unplanned and uncontrolled fire in an area of combustible vegetation. Some natural forest ecosystems depend on wildfire. Modern forest management often engages in prescribed burns to mitigate fire risk and promote natural forest cycles. Controlled burns can turn into wildfires if they escape containment lines."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/05/Burnout_ops_on_Mangum_Fire_McCall_Smokejumpers.jpg/330px-Burnout_ops_on_Mangum_Fire_McCall_Smokejumpers.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wildfire"},{"title":"Wildfire (Rachel Platten album)","blocks":[{"text":"Wildfire is the third studio album by American singer and songwriter Rachel Platten. It was her first to be released under a major record label and was released on January 1, 2016, by Columbia Records and Sony Music Entertainment."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/db/Rachel_Platten_-_Wildfire_%28Official_Album_Cover%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wildfire_(Rachel_Platten_album)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/Global_Fires_-_August_and_February_2008.jpg/500px-Global_Fires_-_August_and_February_2008.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/Global_Fires_-_August_and_February_2008.jpg/500px-Global_Fires_-_August_and_February_2008.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm